# =============================================================================
# SEIS — repository-root .gitignore
# =============================================================================
# fastapi-ai-service/ has its own .gitignore for that subproject's runtime
# artifacts (venv, __pycache__, .env, test/lint caches, logs). This file
# covers the repository root: AI coding-assistant configuration/session
# directories (local working state, never meant to be versioned) and this
# repo's internal working documentation, plus generic OS/IDE noise.
# =============================================================================

# --- AI coding assistant config / session directories (local only) ---
.agents/
.claude/
.cursor/
.windsurf/
.continue/
.aider*

# --- Internal working documentation (not part of the shipped codebase) ---
docs/

# --- Python tooling caches (when a tool is run from the repo root) ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- OS / IDE ---
Thumbs.db

